

**792**

**Example 7.** Economicze _f_(z)=1+\(x\)/2+\(x^{2}\)/3 \(+x^{2}\)/4+\(x^{4}\)/5+\(x^{6}\) with _R=_.05.

From **Table 22.3**

\[\begin{array}{l}f(\mathbf{z})=\frac{1}{120}\left[149T_{0}(\mathbf{z})+32T_{2}( \mathbf{z})+3T_{4}(\mathbf{z})\right]\\ \hskip 85.358268pt+\frac{1}{96}\left[76T_{1}(\mathbf{z})+11T_{3}(\mathbf{z})+ T_{5}(\mathbf{z})\right]\end{array}\]

since \(|\widetilde{J}(\mathbf{z})-f(\mathbf{z})|\leq\frac{1}{40}+\frac{1}{96}<.05\)

